{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Build Remove Liquidity Transaction"},"description":"Flash-action: PARTIALLY decreases liquidity from an LP position. The position remains open with reduced liquidity; underlying tokens stay in the account.\n\nFor FULL position exit (burn LP + swap + repay + withdraw), use write_account_close instead: it batches everything into one atomic transaction.\n\nThe returned calldata is time-sensitive \u2014 sign and broadcast within 30 seconds. If the transaction reverts due to price movement, rebuild and sign again immediately (retry at least once before giving up). Response includes tenderly_sim_url and tenderly_sim_status for pre-broadcast validation.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"account_address":{"description":"Arcadia account address","type":"string"},"adjustment":{"description":"Liquidity amount to remove (raw uint128 value as string). Must be less than total liquidity: for full removal use write_account_close.","type":"string"},"asset_address":{"description":"Position manager contract","type":"string"},"asset_id":{"description":"NFT token ID","type":"number"},"chain_id":{"default":8453,"description":"Chain ID: 8453 (Base), 130 (Unichain), 10 (Optimism), or 4663 (Robinhood)","type":"number"}},"required":["account_address","asset_address","asset_id","adjustment"],"type":"object"},"name":"write_account_remove_liquidity","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"after":{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"total_account_value":{"type":"string"},"used_margin":{"type":"string"}},"required":["total_account_value","used_margin"],"type":"object"},"before":{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"total_account_value":{"type":"string"},"used_margin":{"type":"string"}},"required":["total_account_value","used_margin"],"type":"object"},"description":{"type":"string"},"expected_value_change":{"type":"string"},"expected_value_change_unavailable":{"type":"string"},"price_checks":{"items":{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"pool":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string"}},"required":["pool","status"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"tenderly_sim_status":{"enum":["success","failure","unavailable"],"type":"string"},"tenderly_sim_url":{"type":"string"},"transaction":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"chainId":{"type":"number"},"data":{"type":"string"},"to":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"}},"required":["to","data","value","chainId"],"type":"object"}},"required":["transaction"],"type":"object"}}
